## Fix: Configure Health Checks for Backend Service

```typescript
// Create a health check
const healthCheck = new gcp.compute.HealthCheck("backend-health-check", {
    httpHealthCheck: {
        port: 80,
        requestPath: "/health",
    },
    checkIntervalSec: 10,
